--Description / Thinking process:
-- Goal: identify which “quick-play” event (level_start_quickplay, level_fail_quickplay, …)
--       has the WORST user-retention in week-2 (days 8-14) after a user’s first time
--       performing that event between 01-Aug-2018 and 15-Aug-2018.
--
-- Steps (all implemented below):
-- 1. Cohort   (cte: qp_first) – for every user & quick-play event, record the first
--    calendar date they triggered that event within 1-15 Aug.
-- 2. Returns  (cte: ss) – gather *all* session_start rows for Aug-2018 (1-29 Aug),
